          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 13.5 currently transfers ownership of Developments we create to Commerce One whenever it supports them on an ongoing basis; our position is that we own what we pay for and create, so we have replaced that transfer with a support licence back to Commerce One. We have also confirmed that no data of Corio or its Customers is assigned to Commerce One.",
