              "oldText": ", unless such Developments are supported on an ongoing basis by Commerce One in which case Commerce One will retain all ownership rights, including",
              "newText": ". If Commerce One supports any such Developments on an ongoing basis, Corio hereby grants Commerce One a nonexclusive, royalty-free license to use such Developments solely to the extent necessary to provide such support."
            },
            {
              "kind": "replace",
              "paragraphId": "p0116",
              "oldText": "intellectual property rights in the Developments. To the extent that Commerce One would otherwise have a claim of ownership",
              "newText": "To the extent that Commerce One would otherwise have a claim of ownership"
            },
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0116",
              "text": "Corio retains all right, title and interest in and to all data and content of Corio and its Customers that is stored, processed or transmitted using the Software, the MarketSite.net Service or the Corio Servers, and nothing in this Agreement assigns to Commerce One any ownership interest in such data or content or in any Developments owned by Corio."
            }
          ]
